# Fabric Diffuse Texture
# This is a placeholder. In a full production pipeline, you would:
# 1. Create a seamless fabric weave normal map in Substance Designer or Photoshop
# 2. Export as PNG with transparency for any stitching details
# 3. The current model uses procedural PBR materials without external textures
#
# To add textures:
# - Export the chair from Blender after importing chair.glb
# - UV unwrap each mesh part
# - Bake/fabricate textures in your preferred tool
# - Re-export as textured GLB
